msgid "Dump density or orbital values (CUBE)"
msgstr "输出密度或轨道值（CUBE）"

msgid ""
"calls a module which dumps the values of various properties on a spatial "
"parallelopipedal grid to an external file. The purpose is to allow plotting "
"of orbitals, densities and other quantities by external programs. The format"
" of the file is intended to be the same as that produced by other programs."
msgstr ""
"调用一个模块，将空间平行六面体网格上各种属性的值输出到外部文件。目的是允许外部程序绘制轨道、密度和其他量。文件格式旨在与其他程序生成的格式相同。"

msgid ""
"**:math:`n_1`,\\ :math:`n_2`,\\ :math:`n_3`** specify the number of grid "
"points in each of three dimensions. If not specified, sensible defaults are "
"chosen."
msgstr ""
"**:math:`n_1`,\\ :math:`n_2`,\\ :math:`n_3`** "
"指定三个维度中每个维度的网格点数量。如果未指定，则会选择合理的默认值。"

msgid ""
"By default, the last density computed is evaluated on the grid, and written "
"to *filename*. This behaviour can be modified by one or more of the "
"following subcommands."
msgstr "默认情况下，在网格上评估最后计算的密度，并写入 *filename*\\ 。此行为可以通过以下一个或多个子命令进行修改。"

msgid "STEP — setting the point spacing"
msgstr "STEP — 设置点间距"

msgid "DENSITY — source of density"
msgstr "DENSITY — 密度来源"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "POTENTIAL, FIELD — compute electrostatic potential or field"
msgstr "POTENTIAL, FIELD — 计算静电势或电场"

msgid "ORBITAL — source of orbitals"
msgstr "ORBITAL — 轨道来源"

msgid ""
"Note that the CUBE file format precludes simultaneous orbital and density "
"dumps."
msgstr "请注意，CUBE 文件格式不允许同时进行轨道和密度转储。"

msgid "AXIS — direction of grid axes"
msgstr "AXIS — 网格轴的方向"

msgid ""
"*x,y,z* specify the unnormalised direction cosines of one of the three axes "
"defining the grid. Up to three ``AXIS`` commands can be given, but none is "
"required. Axes need not be orthogonal. By default, the first axis is the "
"cartesian :math:`x`, the second is orthogonal to the first and to the "
"cartesian :math:`z`, and the third is orthogonal to the first two."
msgstr ""
"*x,y,z* 指定定义网格的三个轴中一个轴的未归一化方向余弦。最多可以给出三个 ``AXIS`` "
"命令，但并非必需。轴不必正交。默认情况下，第一个轴是笛卡尔 :math:`x` 轴，第二个轴与第一个轴和笛卡尔 :math:`z` "
"轴正交，第三个轴与前两个轴正交。"

msgid "BRAGG — spatial extent of grid"
msgstr "BRAGG — 网格的空间范围"

msgid ""
"Based on the direction of the coordinate axes, a parallelopiped (in the "
"usual case of orthogonal axes, a cuboid) is constructed to contain the "
"molecule completely. The atoms are assumed to be spherical, with an extent "
"proportional to their Bragg radii, and the constant of proportionality can "
"be changed from the default value using"
msgstr ""
"基于坐标轴的方向，构建一个平行六面体（在正交轴的通常情况下为长方体）以完全包含分子。原子被假定为球形，其范围与其布拉格半径成正比，比例常数可以使用以下命令从默认值更改"

msgid ""
"After the parallelopiped has been constructed, the grid is laid out with "
"equal spacing to cover it using the number of points specified on the "
"``CUBE`` command."
msgstr "平行六面体构建完成后，使用 ``CUBE`` 命令指定的点数以等间距方式布置网格以覆盖它。"

msgid "ORIGIN — centroid of grid"
msgstr "ORIGIN — 网格的质心"

msgid ""
"*x,y,z* specify the centroid of the grid. It is usually not necessary to use"
" this option, since the default should suffice for most purposes."
msgstr "*x,y,z* 指定网格的质心。通常无需使用此选项，因为默认值足以满足大多数用途。"

msgid "TITLE — user defined title"
msgstr "TITLE — 用户定义的标题"

msgid "Set a user defined title in the cube file."
msgstr "在 cube 文件中设置用户定义的标题。"

msgid "DESCRIPTION — user defined description"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION — 用户定义的描述"

msgid "Set a user defined description in the cube file."
msgstr "在 cube 文件中设置用户定义的描述。"

msgid "Format of cube file"
msgstr "立方体文件格式"

msgid "The formatted cube file contains the following records"
msgstr "格式化的立方体文件包含以下记录"

msgid "``(A)`` job title."
msgstr "``(A)`` 作业标题。"

msgid "``(A)`` brief description of the file contents."
msgstr "``(A)`` 文件内容的简要描述。"

msgid "``(I5,3F12.6)`` number of atoms, coordinates of grid origin (bohr)."
msgstr "``(I5,3F12.6)`` 原子数，网格原点的坐标（玻尔）。"

msgid ""
"``(I5,3F12.6)`` number of grid points :math:`n_1`, step vector for first "
"grid dimension."
msgstr "``(I5,3F12.6)`` 网格点数量 :math:`n_1`\\ ，第一个网格维度的步长向量。"

msgid ""
"``(I5,3F12.6)`` number of grid points :math:`n_2`, step vector for second "
"grid dimension."
msgstr "``(I5,3F12.6)`` 网格点数量 :math:`n_2`\\ ，第二个网格维度的步长向量。"

msgid ""
"``(I5,3F12.6)`` number of grid points :math:`n_3`, step vector for third "
"grid dimension."
msgstr "``(I5,3F12.6)`` 网格点数量 :math:`n_3`\\ ，第三个网格维度的步长向量。"

msgid ""
"``(I5,4F12.6)`` atomic number, charge and coordinates; one such record for "
"each atom."
msgstr "``(I5,4F12.6)`` 原子序数、电荷和坐标；每个原子对应一条这样的记录。"

msgid ""
"In the case of the density gradient, the cube file will contain a record "
"with a length of :math:`3n_3`, with the three cartesian components "
"contiguous. In the latter case the density data will be written as well to a"
" separate cube file. The file names for the different density data are "
"marked with the extensions <name>_density.cube, <name>_gradient.cube and "
"<name>_laplacian.cube."
msgstr ""
"对于密度梯度的情况，立方体文件将包含一条长度为 :math:`3n_3` "
"的记录，其中三个笛卡尔分量是连续的。在后一种情况下，密度数据也将被写入一个单独的立方体文件。不同密度数据的文件名通过扩展名标记为 "
"<name>_density.cube、<name>_gradient.cube 和 <name>_laplacian.cube。"

msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"The following example shows how cube density and orbital data can be written"
" using the RHF density source for the water molecule:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了如何使用 RHF 密度源为水分子写入立方体密度和轨道数据："

msgid "``CUBE,filename,iflag,$n_1$,$n_2$,$n_3$``"
msgstr "``CUBE,filename,iflag,$n_1$,$n_2$,$n_3$``"

msgid ""
"***filename*** is the unix path name of the file to be written, and its "
"specification is mandatory."
msgstr "***filename*** 是要写入文件的 unix 路径名，其指定是必需的。"

msgid ""
"***iflag*** If *iflag* is negative (default), a formatted file will be "
"written, otherwise unformatted fortran i/o will be used."
msgstr "***iflag*** 若 *\\ iflag* 为负（默认），则写入格式化文件，否则使用非格式化的 Fortran I/O。"

msgid ""
"``STEP,[stepx],[stepy], [stepz]\\\\`` *stepx,stepy, stepz* specify the point"
" spacing in each of three axis directions. By default, the value of "
"*stepx,stepy, stepz* is determined by the number of grid points, the Bragg "
"radii of the atoms, and some related parameters."
msgstr ""
"``STEP,[stepx],[stepy], [stepz]\\\\`` *stepx,stepy, stepz* "
"指定三个坐标轴方向上各自的点间距。默认情况下，\\ *stepx,stepy, stepz* 的值由网格点数目、原子的 Bragg "
"半径以及一些相关参数确定。"

msgid ""
"``DENSITY,[density-source]\\\\`` ``GRADIENT,[density-source]\\\\`` "
"``LAPLACIAN,[density-source]``"
msgstr ""
"``DENSITY,[density-source]\\\\`` ``GRADIENT,[density-source]\\\\`` "
"``LAPLACIAN,[density-source]``"

msgid ""
"Compute the density and, optionally, its gradient and laplacian. "
"*:math:`<`density-source:math:`>`* may be a record number containing the "
"required density, and may contain further qualification, such as set or "
"state number, in the usual way. By default, the last computed density is "
"taken."
msgstr ""
"计算密度，并可选地计算其梯度和拉普拉斯量。\\ *:math:`<`density-source:math:`>`* "
"可以是包含所需密度的记录号，也可以按通常方式包含进一步的限定信息，例如集合号或状态号。默认情况下，采用最后计算的密度。"

msgid "``POTENTIAL,[density-source]\\\\`` ``FIELD,[density-source]\\\\``"
msgstr "``POTENTIAL,[density-source]\\\\`` ``FIELD,[density-source]\\\\``"

msgid "*:math:`<`density-source:math:`>`* is interpreted as for ``DENSITY``"
msgstr "*:math:`<`density-source:math:`>`* 的解释方式与 ``DENSITY`` 相同"

msgid "``ORBITAL,[orbital-list],[RECORD=orbital-source]``"
msgstr "``ORBITAL,[orbital-list],[RECORD=orbital-source]``"

msgid ""
"*:math:`<`orbital-list:math:`>`* is a list of one or more orbital numbers of"
" the form *number.symmetry* or keywords chosen from ``HOMO``, ``LUMO``, "
"``OCC`` (all occupied orbitals), ``ALL``. If nothing is specified, the "
"default is ``HOMO``. *:math:`<`orbital-source:math:`>`* may be a record "
"number containing the required density, and may contain further "
"qualification, such as set number, in the usual way. By default, the last "
"computed orbitals are taken."
msgstr ""
"*:math:`<`orbital-list:math:`>`* 是一个或多个轨道号的列表，形式为 *number.symmetry*\\ ，或从 "
"``HOMO``\\ 、\\ ``LUMO``\\ 、\\ ``OCC``\\ （所有占据轨道）、\\ ``ALL`` "
"中选择的关键字。若未指定任何内容，默认为 ``HOMO``\\ 。\\ *:math:`<`orbital-source:math:`>`* "
"可以是包含所需密度的记录号，也可以按通常方式包含进一步的限定信息，例如集合号。默认情况下，采用最后计算的轨道。"

msgid "``AXIS,x,y,z``"
msgstr "``AXIS,x,y,z``"

msgid "``BRAGG,scale``"
msgstr "``BRAGG,scale``"

msgid "``ORIGIN,x,y,z``"
msgstr "``ORIGIN,x,y,z``"

msgid "``TITLE,title``"
msgstr "``TITLE,title``"

msgid "``DESCRIPTION,description``"
msgstr "``DESCRIPTION,description``"

msgid ""
"``(6E13.5)`` :math:`n_1 \\times n_2` records of length :math:`n_3` "
"containing the values of the density or orbital at each grid point. With "
"default choice of the axes, the inner loop will be over :math:`n_3` points "
"along the cartesian :math:`z` axis, and the outer loop over :math:`n_1` "
"points along the cartesian :math:`x` axis."
msgstr ""
"``(6E13.5)`` :math:`n_1 \\times n_2` 条长度为 :math:`n_3` "
"的记录，包含每个网格点处的密度或轨道值。在默认坐标轴选择下，内层循环沿笛卡尔 :math:`z` 轴遍历 :math:`n_3` 个点，外层循环沿笛卡尔"
" :math:`x` 轴遍历 :math:`n_1` 个点。"

msgid ""
"In the case of a number of orbitals :math:`m`, a separate cube file for each"
" orbital will be written that have the file names "
"<name>_orbital_<num>.<sym>.cube where <num>.<sym> is the num'th orbital in "
"symmetry sym."
msgstr ""
"在有 :math:`m` 个轨道的情况下，将为每个轨道写入单独的立方体文件，文件名为 "
"<name>_orbital_<num>.<sym>.cube，其中 <num>.<sym> 是 symmetry 为 sym 的第 num 个轨道。"

msgid "examples/cube.inp"
msgstr "examples/cube.inp"
